%% A support ticket's path, from report to resolution.
flowchart LR
  report([Customer reports a bug]) --> triage{Reproducible?}
  triage -- no --> ask[Ask for details] -.-> report
  triage -- yes --> sev{Severity}
  subgraph eng [Engineering]
    fix[Write a fix] --> review[[Code review]] --> deploy[(Deploy)]
  end
  sev -->|high| fix
  sev -->|low| backlog[Backlog] --> fix
  deploy --> close((Closed))
  classDef start fill:#dff3e4,stroke:#2f8f4e
  class report,close start
